Any object that accidentally has an `isTrained` property will be misidentified as a NeuralAgent. Use a named-options pattern (`{ eventStore, neuralAgent }`) or two distinct factory methods instead.

**26. Frontend `useWebSocket` Has a Stale Closure on `settings`**
```js
